# 1Password Secrets Reference for Test Environment (CI)
#
# Setup Instructions:
# 1. Create a 1Password vault for your app (e.g., "MyApp")
# 2. Replace "Kasseh.com" below with your vault name
# 3. Create test credential items in 1Password
# 4. Add OP_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_TOKEN to GitHub Secrets
#
# These secrets are loaded during CI test runs via GitHub Actions

# Example: Test API credentials
# TEST_API_KEY=op://Kasseh.com/test-api-credentials/key
# TEST_API_SECRET=op://Kasseh.com/test-api-credentials/secret

# Example: Test database credentials
# TEST_DATABASE_URL=op://Kasseh.com/test-database/connection

# Add your own test secrets below
